  "body": "***PRICE EXPECTATIONS WELL BELOW CV***\r\n\r\nThis is your final opportunity to secure the last remaining home in this peaceful cul-de-sac—a beautifully crafted, Brand New, Freehold 4-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom residence designed for effortless modern family living. Combining quality finishes, everyday comfort and a highly convenient location, this impressive home is ready for you to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nDownstairs features light-filled, separate living and dining areas with seamless indoor-outdoor flow, creating an inviting setting for family life and entertaining. At the heart of the home is a stylish designer kitchen equipped with premium Miele appliances and a Robam rangehood. An internal-access garage incorporating the laundry and additional storage adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs features four generous bedrooms, including a private master suite with an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. A well-appointed family bathroom serves the remaining three bedrooms, while central air conditioning keeps the entire home comfortable throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet, family-friendly cul-de-sac in sought-after East Auckland, this home is conveniently located close to everything that matters:\r\n\r\n• Within walking distance of Macleans Primary School\r\n• Minutes from Half Moon Bay Marina for waterfront dining and recreation\r\n• Close to Pak’nSave, Woolworths and Highland Park Shopping Centre\r\n\r\nThis opportunity won’t last long. Act now and make it yours!\r\n\r\n• 173m2\r\n• 4 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms\r\n• Garage\r\n• Zones: Macleans Primary, Pakuranga College",
